<p>NOTE: The third quarter 1996 excluded non-recurring merger restructuring and integration charge of $0.4 milion after tax and $0.2 million after tax gain for property sales. The first nine months 1996 excluded $3 million after tax or $0.13 per share charge and $1.6 million after tax gain for property sale. Q3 '95 and first nine months 1995 exclude after tax expenses of $0.6 million and $1.7 million respectively for hostile takeover defence.</p>
